<!--
  Status-bar small icon (v0.5: chat-notification-01, HugeIcons stroke-rounded — FIREBASE_0.5_PLAN.md §8a / D6).
  The system tints this white-on-transparent and ignores colour. Rendered as strokes at
  strokeWidth=2 (1.5 reads too faint at ~24dp status-bar size); the badge dot is filled solid
  per D6 so a thin 2-unit ring around a 3-unit hole doesn't mush at small size — that dot is the
  icon's identity ("chat-*notification*", not "chat").

  FAILURE MODE this flirts with: a small icon SystemUI cannot inflate makes the WHOLE
  notification disappear with no error surfaced to the app. Avoid degenerate near-zero-length
  arcs.
  (NotificationUtils references R.drawable.ic_notification at 2 call sites:
  postTestNotification and postReplyAck. As of v0.5.1 §F the two *reminder* posts use the
  per-category ic_notif_habit / ic_notif_food / ic_notif_med instead, with this file as the
  fallback returned by NotificationUtils.smallIconFor(null)).
-->
